They are reproduced in-tree so the model has a stable, citable source of truth.
They are **not** part of the software license grant for this repository; all
rights in the design documents remain with their authors. Where the model and a
design document disagree, the design document is authoritative and the model is
the defect, unless a decision record under `docs/decisions/` states otherwise.

